# Code-download scope
# The downloadable project consists of code/, tools/, and the root run/build notes.
# Local evidence, source materials, staging files, and process archives stay outside
# the code download scope.

# Local evidence, design documents, and reference materials
/Report/
/material/
/PNG/
/Reference/
/submission_package_template/
/logs_backup/
/人工智能及应用大类其他人工智能应用赛道说明与提交要求.docx
/智驭新风-数智链大赛参赛分析.md
/CODE_REFACTOR_RECORD.md

# Root-level report/material files
/*.docx
/*.pdf
/*.ppt
/*.pptx
/*.mp4
/*.mov
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg

# Nested repositories and duplicate source mirror
**/.git/
/code/code/code/

# Build and dependency outputs
**/.pio/
**/build/
**/install/
**/log/
**/dist/
**/node_modules/
**/backups/
**/codex/
**/.vscode/
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/*.egg-info/
**/outputs/

# Caches and temporary files
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/*.py[cod]
**/~$*
**/*~
**/*.tmp
**/*.temp
**/*.swp
**/*.swo

